      "side": 1,
      "message": "This comparison rejects valid SHA-256/384/512 RSA signatures when the AlgorithmIdentifier omits NULL parameters, preventing those peers from establishing an SA. The focused ASAN tests reproduced AUTHENTICATION_FAILED for all three hashes with independently verified signatures. Could we accept the absent-parameters variants as well, as [RFC 4055 §5](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4055.html#section-5) requires?",
