      "side": 1,
      "message": "Entry 0 emits the 72-byte PSS identifier with an explicit default trailerField, whereas [RFC 4055 §3.1](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4055.html#section-3.1) requires generation to omit that field. The wire-output test confirms this encoding; rejection by another implementation has not been reproduced. Could we select the existing 67-byte entry for signing and update the outbound expectations?",
